       Both the eeccvvtt() and ffccvvtt() functions  return  a  pointer  to  a  static
       string  containing  the  ASCII  representation  of  _n_u_m_b_e_r.  The static
       string is overwritten by each call to eeccvvtt() or ffccvvtt().

